d": 7, "name": "Virtual Reality"}], "release_dates": [{"id": 821162, "date": 1738281600, "platform": 386, "y": 2025, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 821163, "date": 1743379200, "platform": 386, "y": 2025, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1670728, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczt54.jpg"}, {"id": 1670729, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczt55.jpg"}, {"id": 1670726, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczt52.jpg"}, {"id": 1670727, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczt53.jpg"}], "slug": "moke-horror", "summary": "Step into the chilling world of Moke: The Descent, a psychological horror game designed to push your nerves to the limit. Navigate through a vast, unsettling environment filled with abandoned facilities, eerie ruins, and decaying landscapes. The sense of isolation grows as you realize you're never truly alone.\nThe environment is ever-changing. Periodically, all lights will shut off, plunging you into darkness. This is when the Whisperers emerge\u2014shadowy figures that move silently, following your every step. Their whispers distort reality, heightening the fear that you are being hunted.\nSurvival is a constant struggle. The Brute relentlessly pursues you, while the Crawler moves quietly in the dark, its eerie clicks a reminder that danger is near. Every time you destroy data in sandbox mode for points, the monsters grow more aggressive, adding an extra layer of terror as you race to climb the leaderboard.\nMoke: The Descent thrives on atmosphere, with haunting environments and a growing sense of dread. Will you uncover the truth behind the descent, or will you be consumed by the terrifying world below?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/moke-horror"}